{"meta":{"id":"tt4419684","type":"movie","name":"Tierras Perdidas","imdb_id":"tt4419684","description":"Una reina, desesperada por obtener el don de cambiar de forma, hace una jugada audaz: contrata a la hechicera Gray Alys, una mujer tan temida como poderosa. Enviada al desierto fantasmal de las Tierras Perdidas, Alys y su guía, el vagabundo Boyce, deben burlar y luchar contra el hombre y el demonio en una fábula que explora la naturaleza del bien y el mal, la deuda y la satisfacción, el amor y la pérdida.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt4419684.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oI5uHu7lrQ0mBBH1c8OHCAkCq4x.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sZQyzO2K39u69LUmgN5bGqecT7K.png","genres":["Acción","Aventura","Fantasía","Terror"],"releaseInfo":"2025","released":"2025-02-27T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"101 min","imdbRating":"4.7","country":"Germany, Switzerland","cast":["Milla Jovovich","Dave Bautista","Arly Jover","Amara Okereke","Fraser James","Simon Lööf","Deirdre Mullins","Sebastian Stankiewicz","Tue Lunding","Jacek Dzisiewicz","Eveline Hall","Kamila Klamut","Jan Kowalewski","Tomasz Cymerman","Amir Azimov","Sandor Abdullaev","Nicolas Stone","Ian Hanmore","Caoilinn Springall","Pawel Wysocki"],"director":["Paul W. S. Anderson"],"writer":["George R.R. Martin","Constantin Werner","Paul W. S. Anderson"],"trailers":[{"source":"CMyrp5Vk3mU","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer","ytId":"CMyrp5Vk3mU","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"CMyrp5Vk3mU","title":"Official Trailer"}],"links":[{"name":"4.7","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt4419684"},{"name":"Acción","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/movie/top?genre=Acci%C3%B3n"},{"name":"Aventura","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/movie/top?genre=Aventura"},{"name":"Fantasía","cat